libjxl
------------------------------------------
JPEG XL image format reference implementation

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libIlmImf2_5_26-2.5.8-1
  libavif16-1.4.2-1bl2
  libbrotli-devel-1.2.1-1
  libbrotlidec1-1.2.1-1
  libbrotlienc1-1.2.1-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgif7-6.1.3-1
  libhwy-devel-1.4.0-1bl2
  libhwy1-1.4.0-1bl2
  libilmbase2_5_25-2.5.8-1
  libjpeg8-3.2.0-1
  libjxl-devel-0.12.0-1bl1
  libjxl0.12-0.12.0-1bl1
  libpng16-1.6.59-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libwebp7-1.6.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libavif-devel-1.4.2-1bl2
  libbrotli-devel-1.2.1-1
  libgif-devel-6.1.3-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libhwy-devel-1.4.0-1bl2
  libjpeg-devel-3.2.0-1
  libopenexr-devel-2.5.8-1
  libpng-devel-1.6.59-1
  libwebp-devel-1.6.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libjxl/libjxl.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libjxl-0.12.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libjxl-0.12.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libjxl-0.12.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libjxl-0.12.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libjxl0.12-0.12.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libjxl-devel-0.12.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

